  "prefLabel": "Ins 8001.09 Rates",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ins 8001.09 Rates. Rates associated with FMLI coverage shall be reviewed and approved in accordance with Part Ins 4100 or as otherwise indicated under applicable New Hampshire law.\n\nSource. #13499, eff 11-30-22",
